### ===============================
### Health check
### ===============================
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### ===============================
### POSTS API
### ===============================

### Create a new post
POST http://localhost:3000/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My secound post",
  "sender": "Mevo",
  "content": "Hello world"
}


### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:3000/post


### Get post by id
# Replace <POST_ID> with a real post id
GET http://localhost:3000/post/<POST_ID>

### Get post by sender
# Replace <SENDER> with a real sender name
GET http://localhost:3000/post?sender=Mevo





### ===============================
### COMMENTS API
### ===============================

### Create a new comment
POST http://localhost:3000/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "<POST_ID>",  # Replace <POST_ID> with a real post id
  "sender": "Mevo",
  "content": "Nice post"
}


### Get comment by id
# Replace <COMMENT_ID> with a real comment id
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/<COMMENT_ID>


### Update comment
PUT http://localhost:3000/comments/<COMMENT_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated comment text"
}

### Update Post
PUT http://localhost:3000/post/<POST_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "sender": "Ofek",
  "content": "This post was fully replaced using PUT"
}


### Delete comment
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comments/<COMMENT_ID>

### Get all comments for a post by post id
GET http://localhost:3000/post/<POST_ID>/comments